        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15088#issuecomment-6525657382\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15088\">issue #15088</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks for the report, but this is currently expected behavior because <code>wasm.h</code> lags quite a bit behind the standard itself. The only option here really is to make sure we've got a function that works (e.g. <code>wasmtime_valtype_new</code>). I agree though the documentation could probably be more clear in this respect.</p>\n</blockquote>",
